<!-- ================= 2. ABOUT: BEFORE / AFTER ================= -->
<section class="sec about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="wrap about__grid">
    <div class="about__copy rv">
      <p class="label">About MoirAI Cloud</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="about-title">We built MoirAI Cloud to make infrastructure simpler to run</h2>
      <p class="lead">Most teams keep one console for compute, another for the network, a third for storage and a monitoring stack on top. When something breaks, the answer is spread across all four.</p>
      <p>Synaptix™ puts those jobs in one operating environment. The data you need is already in one place, and the AI working beside your team reads it too.</p>
      <ul class="ticks">
        <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Get more useful compute from the hardware you already own</li>
        <li><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Spend less on operational overhead, idle resources and long-term infrastructure cost</li>
