    <div class="why__steps">
      <div class="why__intro rv">
        <p class="label">Why Synaptix™</p>
        <h2 class="h2" id="why-title">Why infrastructure teams choose Synaptix™</h2>
        <p class="lead">Scroll through the reasons. The matching layer lights up in the diagram.</p>
      </div>
      <article class="step" data-step="ai">
        <span class="step__n">Reason 1</span>
        <h3>Integrated AI operations</h3>
        <p>The AI is part of the operating layer, not a bolt-on. It sees the same state, logs and metrics your team sees, so its suggestions come with context. Your team approves what runs.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step" data-step="unified">
        <span class="step__n">Reason 2</span>
        <h3>Unified infrastructure control</h3>
        <p>Compute, networking and storage are managed from one connected layer. You stop moving between disconnected tools, and a change in one place shows up everywhere else.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step" data-step="foundation">
        <span class="step__n">Reason 3</span>
        <h3>Open operating platform underneath</h3>
        <p>MoirAI Cloud's own operating platform sits on established infrastructure technologies. You modernize on a foundation your team can understand, with less risk than a ground-up rebuild.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step" data-step="envs">
        <span class="step__n">Reason 4</span>
        <h3>Interoperability</h3>
        <p>It works across data centers, private cloud and hybrid infrastructure, so you can modernize one environment at a time instead of all at once.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

